Hi Andrew,

Thanks for the quick reply. This is one of the models that ran before but now doesn’t converge:

G =~ NA*F1 + F2 + F3 + F4

F1 =~ NA*SMKCES + PACKYE + SMKDEP + ALCDEP + ALCFRQ + COCDEP + CANEV + SMKINI + SMKAGE

F2 =~ NA*CANDEP + COCDEP + OPIODEP + SMKAGE

F3 =~ NA*ALCDEP + ALCCON + ALCFRQ + ALCP

F4 =~ NA*CANEV + CANFL + SMKINI

G~~1*G

F1~~1*F1

F2~~1*F2

F3~~1*F3

F4~~1*F4

G ~~ 0*F1 + 0*F2 + 0*F3 + 0*F4

F1 ~~ 0*F2 + 0*F3 + 0*F4

F2 ~~ 0*F3 + 0*F4

F3 ~~ 0*F4

Unfortunately, no unstandardised output is printed to help trouble shooting. This is the output I got previously (I was rerunning because I needed to reformat the p-value column for a submission). The path estimates are pretty wild in places (not selecting this model for follow up), but it did run with decent fit estimates.

If you want to do some digging I can share the results and/or covariance matrix via e-mail.

Cheers,

Joëlle

