To add some more information:

Error in OLS & beta :

  operations are possible only for numeric, logical or complex types

This seems to be coming from line 118 in sumstats_main.R:

if(OLS & beta){
...
}

OLS and beta should be correctly getting the boolean and string values from the function call. The string value of beta should be coerced into TRUE, and my OLS value for this is FALSE. However, it seems to be failing here for some reason.

-John

